{"seq":4,"slug":"microservices-data","title":"数据管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"database-decomposition","title":"数据库拆分策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/database-decomposition","wordCount":1860,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing","title":"事件溯源模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/event-sourcing","wordCount":1724,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-consistency","title":"数据一致性模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/data-consistency","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"database-per-service","title":"每服务一数据库模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/database-per-service","wordCount":1778,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据管理-简介\">数据管理 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦微服务架构下的数据管理挑战，从每服务独立数据库到事件溯源与 CQRS，再到跨服务数据一致性保障，帮助读者设计可靠的分布式数据架构。</p>\n<p><strong>每服务一数据库模式</strong>讲解微服务数据自治的核心原则，分析每服务一数据库模式的优势与挑战，以及数据库选型与数据隔离的实现策略。</p>\n<p><strong>事件溯源与 CQRS</strong>介绍事件溯源将状态变化记录为事件序列的设计理念，以及 CQRS 将读写模型分离的架构模式，分析两者的协同优势与实现复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>数据一致性与同步策略</strong>探讨微服务环境下的数据一致性保障方法，包括最终一致性模型、事件传播机制和数据同步的技术方案。</p>\n<p>建议读者先理解数据自治的核心原则，再学习事件溯源和 CQRS 的高级模式，最后掌握一致性保障的实用策略。</p>\n"}